  "venue": "same objects and geometry; the rebuild already carries the 0.4.0 statuses and evidence kinds that scripts/convert_tennis_status.py added to the stored scene later",
  "not yet in the run list": "none: the stored final scene equals the props output (complete and timing were not applied after props in the stored chain); export and status added 2026-11-19",
  "props": "same objects; racket and ball geometry within 0.02; differences only the 0.4.0 statuses (as venue) and file paths written absolute"
 }
}
